{"id":326,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自由・平等・対話を重んじる普連土","feature_description":"普連土学園中学校・高等学校は、『Let Your Lives Speak』を教育理念に、自由、平等、対話、平和主義を大切にする学校です。毎朝の礼拝を核に、互いを尊重しながら学ぶ姿勢を育て、豊かな人間力を養います。学校生活全体が理念とつながっている点が特徴です。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5612,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5613,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5614,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5615,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5616,"name":"ハイキング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5617,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5618,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5619,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5620,"name":"フォークダンス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5621,"name":"E.S.S.部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5622,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5623,"name":"音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.jp/schoollife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5624,"name":"軽音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.friends.ac.j